title: Faust3
---
<<declare $playerName = "Holder">>
<<gathervars>>
<<freezePlayer>>
Faust messaged you to meet him at the gym. You gripped your
phone, scrolling as you waited for him.

Hanging out wasn't something you did often, so his invite was a
surprise. Footsteps made you look up. Faust approached.

You: "Oh hey,"

You tucked your phone away. He lit up, stopping in front of you.
His grey hair was neatly combed this time.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>
Faust: "You're here,"

He sounded surprised. You nodded, unsure why he said that. He
checked his watch, humming.

Faust: "Let's go to the campus cafe. My class starts soon,"

You: "That's fine,"

He beamed, and you both headed there.

It wasn't a long walk. Leaving the gym, you made your way to
the cafe together.

Your mind wandered. He had said he had class soon. You forgot
he was a student too.

You: "Hey Faust,"

Faust: "Yeah? What is it?"

You glanced at the sky, now bright and sunny.

You: "We've known each other two weeks, but I don't know what
you're studying,"

He processed it, then laughed sheepishly.

Faust: "Oh god, you're right,"

You reached the cafe. He opened the door for you.

Faust: "I study computer science,"

His smile dropped slightly. You looked surprised. He noticed.

Faust: "Did you think I did sport?"

You sighed. He laughed.

Faust: "Most people do. I don't blame you,"

You ordered and sat down.

You: "You do spend a lot of time in the gym,"

Faust nodded, eating.

Faust: "...I do wish I did sport,"

His voice was quiet, almost sad. His eyes darkened.

Then suddenly, he smiled again.

Faust: "Ignore me. I shouldn't have said that,"

The topic dropped quickly.

-> Pry further
    <<incRelationship "Faust" 1>>
    <<jump PryFurther>>
-> Leave it be
    <<jump LeaveBe>>
===

title: PryFurther
---
You took a bite, glancing at him.

You: "I don't mind. You can talk about it,"

Faust stayed quiet. Only chatter filled the space. He sighed.

Faust: "I grew up playing a lot of sport. I loved it. I wanted
to keep doing tennis,"

He paused, looking away.

Faust: "Life caught up. Sports wouldn't sustain me,"

His tone was flat, distant. Not like him.

You frowned, uneasy.

He saw your expression and smiled again.

Faust: "But that's enough sad talk,"

Something told you not to push further.
===

title: LeaveBe
---
Faust always seemed secretive. This topic was clearly sensitive.

You chose not to ask more, eating quietly.

You respected his space.

Faust shifted the conversation, and you let it go.
===

title: Faust3Continue
---
Faust: "Enough about me. How's your essay going?"

You groaned. He laughed lightly.

You looked away, annoyed.

The thought made you grimace. You'd rather talk to your parents
about it.

-> Can we talk about something else?
    <<incRelationship "Faust" 1>>
    <<jump CanWeTalk>>
-> Lie about how you're doing
    <<jump LieDoing>>
-> Confide in him
    <<jump ConfideFaust>>
===

title: CanWeTalk
---
You: "I'm not in the mood to discuss it,"

Faust stared briefly, unreadable. Then he smiled.

He didn't push, but stayed silent.

It grew tense.

Faust: "Want to see my childhood dog?"

You played along.

You: "Yeah? Is that even a question?"

He moved closer, showing his phone.

A white and tan dog lay on grass, tongue out, smiling.

You: "They're adorable!"

Faust smiled proudly.

Faust: "His name is Jack. He's a Jack Russel,"

You snorted.

You: "Very creative,"

Faust: "I was nine!"

You both laughed, the tension gone.

<<jump F3End>>
===

title: LieDoing
---
You didn't feel like opening up.

You: "Pretty good. Everyone's responses are interesting,"

Faust paused, then continued eating.

Faust: "Who's doing your questionnaire besides me?"

You thought briefly.

You: "Sorry Faust, that's confidential,"

You smiled playfully.

Faust sighed dramatically, slumping.

<<jump F3End>>
===

title: ConfideFaust
---
You thought it over while drinking.

He had opened up a little. Maybe you could too.

You: "It's a mess,"

Faust perked up, listening.

You: "Some participants are difficult,"

Faust hummed.

You: "There's this guy who's always brooding. So rude,"

Faust: "That sounds hard,"

You kept going.

You: "He's always in the library. Wearing heavy clothes even
now,"

You were ranting now.

Faust didn't interrupt.

But he had stopped eating.

He was glaring at you.

<<jump F3End>>
===

title: F3End
---
An alarm went off. Faust jumped.

Faust: "Ah—"

He groaned, checking his phone.

Faust: "Class is starting soon,"

He sighed, clearly annoyed.
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>
<<allowPlayerToMove>>

<<loadScene "CampusGrounds">>
===